A rights mask may carry bits past RIGHT_ALL, which a later right could not then be given;
a refused call fails at the first check it fails, the unread arguments' among them.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a refused call did not fail at the first check it fails
Witness: fuzz unread-arguments-zero

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -1056,7 +1056,7 @@ static int shape_check(uint32_t op, const struct cap *cap, const uint32_t *arg)
         reads = shape_reads(op, cap, arg, reads);
     }
     uint32_t unread = ((reads & SHAPE_A1) ? 0 : arg[1]) | ((reads & SHAPE_A2) ? 0 : arg[2]) |
-                      ((reads & SHAPE_A3) ? 0 : arg[3]) | ((reads & SHAPE_RIGHTS_A3) ? arg[3] & ~(uint32_t)RIGHT_ALL : 0);
+                      ((reads & SHAPE_A3) ? 0 : arg[3]);
     return unread != 0 ? KERR_INVALID_ARG : KERR_OK;
 }
 
